flowchart TD
RunNSGA2["**run_nsga2_optimization**<br/>Configures problem and algorithm<br/>Starts the MOO run"]
NSGA2Alg["**NSGA II Algorithm**<br/>Population selection crossover mutation<br/>Eliminate duplicates"]
SamplingCrossoverMutation["**Genetic Operators**<br/>Integer sampling SBX crossover PM mutation"]
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Defines 6 decision variables<br/>Handles parallel evaluation and constraints"]
DecisionVars["**Decision Variables**<br/>post_loading_buffer post_conveyor_buffer<br/>post_washing_buffer pre_press1_buffer<br/>pre_press2_buffer post_press12_buffer<br/>Each integer {1-10}"]
MinimizeCall["**minimize call**<br/>Invokes pymoo minimize<br/>Saves history"]
Pool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Runs evaluate tasks in parallel<br/>Uses n_cores processes"]
EvaluateIndividual["**evaluate_single_individual**<br/>Runs n replications per design<br/>Returns avg WIP and negative avg throughput"]
RunSimCaps["**run_simulation_with_caps**<br/>Builds model using capacities<br/>Runs warmup and measurement"]
SimpyEnv["**simpy Environment**<br/>Schedules processes sampling and timeouts"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer Class**<br/>Attributes cap delay tokens store<br/>Methods put get in_transit_count free_capacity"]
MachineClass["**Machine Class**<br/>Attributes process_time availability mttr<br/>working_power waiting_power capacity<br/>Methods run _breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
PartGenerator["**part_generator**<br/>Creates parts into raw input<br/>Rate one per second"]
Metrics["**Objectives**<br/>WIP to minimize<br/>Throughput to maximize stored as negative objective"]
Results["**Optimization Result**<br/>Pareto front and history object"]
ExportCSV["**export_history_to_csv**<br/>Serializes feasible solutions from history<br/>Writes KPIs and capacities to CSV"]

